{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060090/block/singleImage/3247401/df/01M5PPCZFADY8J87XHWCQW8HYB.jpg?updatedAt=1792836858\"/><figcaption>一名43歲持香港身份證的尼泊爾籍女子，涉嫌以懷疑美元偽鈔兌換貨幣被捕。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>一名43歲持香港身份證的尼泊爾籍女子，涉嫌以懷疑美元偽鈔兌換貨幣被捕。 5張假鈔號碼相同 警方今午2時06分，接獲彌敦道514號一間地舖找換店職員報案，指有人以美元偽鈔兌換貨幣。據了解，涉事外幣是面值100美元的鈔票，5張假鈔號碼相同。警員以涉嫌行使偽製紙幣拘捕婦人，現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:42:08.248370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:14:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:38:16.252565+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:44.325897+00:00","content_hash":"3b87dca6ae6d756172742ebe0f741cb8145c67d0faa9e365bf90b268c9fd3d87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}